        "stepNumber": 4,
        "title": "Horneado / Reducción",
        "text": "2) Using an electric mixer, I use my KitchenAid with the whisk attachment, whisk together the queso crema, vanilla, and icing azúcar blanco until smooth and then add the caramel and whisk again until smooth and lump free – this could take a couple of minutes, I whisk it at half speed so not too quick or slow!.",
